      },
      "message": "De-bloat non-code artifacts and make CI cached and browser-free\n\nRemoves the point-in-time evidence bundle, benchmark scripts, Playwright\njourneys, BUILD_CHECKPOINT.json and docs/qualification.md (nothing in\nsrc/, tests/ or build.rs references them). scripts/check now refuses a\nNode/npm other than the CI pins (web/.nvmrc = 22.23.2, npm 10.9.8), runs\nno Chromium download and no fixture demos; scripts/build-web no longer\nappends CLAIM/RELEASE lines to ../AGENT_CHAT.md. The workflow gains\npinned cargo and npm caches and only runs pushes on main plus pull\nrequests, so a PR no longer triggers two identical runs.\n\nPlan of record PR 2a: ~/.claude/plans/please-study-the-tips-snazzy-canyon.md\n\nbf-author: claude/claude-orch\nbf-claim: AGENT_CHAT.md 2026-09-18T16:03Z\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
